[Verse 1]
[00:09.73]You buy bitcoin at the price you deserve
[00:11.53]So if you missed out or sold it early
[00:13.87]Well that’s the price that you paid
[00:15.07]For the tuition you earned
[00:16.27]You won’t make the mistake
[00:17.47]A second time round surely
[00:19.23]We saw the dot com bubble that bursted
[00:21.40]It took many things with it
[00:23.42]And that’s a zero sum game
