[00:40.48]Commercial lien that’s a fatal error
[00:42.28]Still have to be a player
[00:42.94]Hate the game and still a player
[00:44.06]Play it safe you still get played
[00:45.64]But learn to adapt and then play it better

[Hook]
[00:47.78]Money don’t grow on trees
[00:50.18]Once upon a time, printed on machines
